{"id": 2041958, "status": 3, "overall": 3, "occupation_name": "교육", "employ_status_name": false, "date": "2021. 01", "updated_at": "2026. 06", "do_not_report": false, "city_name": {"id": 1, "name": "서울", "country_id": 2, "weight": 1, "active": true, "created_at": "2014-02-13T19:33:47.000+09:00", "updated_at": "2015-10-26T17:54:22.000+09:00", "is_other": false, "needs_review": false, "parent_id": null}, "title": "중소기업이라고,하기에도 작은규모\n체계적이지않는구조\n적막한사무실분위기", "auth": "opened", "pros": "퇴근이 거의,칼퇴\n서로 터치없음\n그냥.내할일만하면됨\n연차자유로움", "cons": "터치가없는반면,너무.개인주의\n외국계회사도 저정도는아닌데\n직급도의미없음\n무슨회사가 창살없는감옥같이 숨소리도 .다날꺼같은적막함", "message_to_management": "일하는사람은하고\n일없는데 돈만받아가는직원은\n좀.살펴보세요\n누구는 열씨미일하는데도 알아주지도않고\n누구는 눈가리고아웅하는것도 모르시고", "comments": 0, "comment_array": [], "current_page": "/api/v4/companies/reviews/330171/reviews.json?page=4", "is_survey": false, "last_year_at_employer": 2019, "is_recommend_badge_visible": false, "score": {"overall": 3, "advancement_rating": 2, "compensation_rating": 2, "worklife_balance_rating": 3, "culture_rating": 2, "management_rating": 3}, "is_helpful": false, "helpful_count": 2, "next_year_rating": 3, "recommend_to_friend": false, "company_picked": false}
